The github plugin packages GitHub's official remote MCP server
(https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server) operated by GitHub,
licensed under the MIT License. Agent workflow skills are adapted from
the OpenAI Codex GitHub plugin (Apache-2.0) and the Cursor GitHub
marketplace plugin (MIT).

The vkusvill plugin packages VkusVill's official remote MCP server
(https://mcp.vkusvill.ru/mcp) operated by VkusVill (https://vkusvill.ru).
Product catalog, prices, recipes, and shop data remain VkusVill's.
